### Login GFT e armazenamento automático do JWT
POST {{baseUrl}}/api/v1/auth/token
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "username": "{{gftUsername}}",
  "password": "{{gftPassword}}"
}

> {%
  client.global.set("accessToken", response.body.accessToken);
%}

### Login Bradesco e armazenamento automático do JWT
POST {{baseUrl}}/api/v1/auth/token
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "username": "{{bradescoUsername}}",
  "password": "{{bradescoPassword}}"
}

> {%
  client.global.set("accessToken", response.body.accessToken);
%}

### Empresas ligadas ao CPF
POST {{baseUrl}}/api/v1/customers/companies
Authorization: Bearer {{accessToken}}
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "year": 2026,
  "documentType": "CPF",
  "document": "05685862717"
}

### O mesmo CPF com máscara
POST {{baseUrl}}/api/v1/customers/companies
Authorization: Bearer {{accessToken}}
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "year": 2026,
  "documentType": "CPF",
  "document": "056.858.627-17"
}

### Todos os registros nas quatro empresas do exemplo
POST {{baseUrl}}/api/v1/customers/records
Authorization: Bearer {{accessToken}}
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "year": 2026,
  "documentType": "CPF",
  "document": "05685862717",
  "companies": [
    "10007037000103",
    "10014956000104",
    "10022875000148",
    "10049118000168"
  ]
}

### Apenas uma empresa
POST {{baseUrl}}/api/v1/customers/records
Authorization: Bearer {{accessToken}}
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "year": 2026,
  "documentType": "CPF",
  "document": "05685862717",
  "companies": ["10007037000103"]
}

### Busca paginada com filtros (repita com "cursor" = nextCursor para a próxima página)
POST {{baseUrl}}/api/v1/customers/search
Authorization: Bearer {{accessToken}}
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "year": 2026,
  "documentType": "CPF",
  "document": "05685862717",
  "product": "invest",
  "updatedFrom": "2026-01-01T00:00:00Z",
  "limit": 2
}

> {%
  client.global.set("nextCursor", response.body.nextCursor);
%}

### Próxima página
POST {{baseUrl}}/api/v1/customers/search
Authorization: Bearer {{accessToken}}
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "year": 2026,
  "documentType": "CPF",
  "document": "05685862717",
  "limit": 2,
  "cursor": "{{nextCursor}}"
}

### Exportação em CSV (format=xlsx para Excel)
POST {{baseUrl}}/api/v1/customers/export?format=csv
Authorization: Bearer {{accessToken}}
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "year": 2026,
  "documentType": "CPF",
  "document": "05685862717"
}

### Histórico das minhas consultas
GET {{baseUrl}}/api/v1/audit/history?limit=10
Authorization: Bearer {{accessToken}}

### Chaves públicas dos tokens (JWKS)
GET {{baseUrl}}/api/v1/auth/jwks

### Documento inválido: resposta esperada 400
POST {{baseUrl}}/api/v1/customers/companies
Authorization: Bearer {{accessToken}}
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "year": 2026,
  "documentType": "CPF",
  "document": "123"
}

### Health check público
GET {{baseUrl}}/actuator/health

### OpenAPI público
GET {{baseUrl}}/v3/api-docs
